      "message": "[warning] Line 158: 🟡 `isSessionConfiguredByClient()` infers client ownership from `PlayAndRecord` alone, but this category can remain after this layer’s own capture session (`destroyAudioLayer` deactivates the session but does not restore category). That creates a false positive on later playback-only starts, skipping category/mode/options setup and changing non-call behavior. Track ownership explicitly (e.g., a flag set only when client ownership is known, or when this layer set the category) and only skip `setCategory` when that ownership signal is true.",
